# ============================================================================
# annotate landing revamp — D1 Ember Nocturne v2 (Night Desk refined) — FULL PAGE
# Model: nano banana (gemini / gemini-2.5-flash-image) — pinned below.
# AI-GENERATED MEDIA: disclose as AI-generated when published.
# Gate A PASSED 2026-10-18 (user approved D1/D2/D3 generation).
# Copy: design/landing/COPY-v2.md §2 (headline + subhead + CTA pair).
# Run: generate-media-prompt design/landing/prompts/d1-ember-nocturne-v2/full-page.media.prompt
# Text budget: 10 strings — the subhead is rendered truncated at its first
#   sentence for render legibility; the full approved subhead lives in
#   COPY-v2 §2. Ticket push is PLANNED: no ticket-creation card anywhere —
#   the roadmap row may carry only a tiny "Soon" chip.
# IA section order (approved): hero → try-it demo band → 7-step walkthrough →
#   features bento → embed snippet → for agents/MCP → roadmap → FAQ → final CTA.
# COPY CORRECTION 2026-10-18 (user): hero secondary CTA is now "Start free"
#   (was "Add to your site"); hero caption and embed heading added; the three
#   embed steps render as bars for text budget (full strings: COPY-v2 §10).
# Build-lane motion notes (not part of the render): ring draw-on via
#   stroke-dashoffset ~400ms; rail cards fade +12px, 40ms stagger; ambient
#   glow pulse 4s on active pin; reduced-motion strips halos, keeps 2px
#   solid outline.
# ============================================================================
schema: '0.4'
id: annotate-landing-ember-nocturne-v2-fullpage
type: image
quality: high
service: gemini
model: gemini-2.5-flash-image

prompt:
  text: |
    Full-page desktop website mockup, tall portrait composition, one continuous
    dark landing page shown top to bottom. Near-black canvas #0B0B10 with
    strict warm ember glow discipline: the ONLY saturated orange elements are
    one ring highlight, one comment pin, and the primary buttons; everything
    else steps by brightness alone. Top: slim dark navigation bar, wordmark
    reading exactly "annotate" left, four small gray nav-link bars, one
    ember-filled pill button carrying no text on the right. Hero splits
    left/right: left column has a small gray eyebrow bar,
    the two-line large headline "Feedback that points at the thing.", a
    two-line muted subhead reading "annotate pins threaded comments to the
    exact element or text they're about." with both words "annotate" and
    "threaded" spelled exactly — the complete sentence, every word present,
    all in plain muted gray — one ember primary button "Try it on
    this page" beside one outlined button "Start free", and a one-line small
    muted caption below the buttons reading "No signup to look around. To
    post or install: create an account, add your site, paste your tag.";
    right side a
    large flat dark browser window filling most of the frame width: title bar
    with three small GRAY dots, dark app page of gray placeholder bars and
    card shapes, one "Export" button ringed in crisp glowing ember orange with
    a small pin marker, a thin luminous orange connector to a raised dark
    comment thread card with two muted orange-tinted circle avatars and short
    comment bars, a thin orange arrow to a compact monospaced agent card
    reading "patch ready" (spelled exactly) with a small orange check, and a
    tiny "Resolved" badge directly beneath that agent card. A floating dark
    comment rail card with three short rows is flush-docked against the
    browser's right edge with no gap, clearly attached; the rail and the
    ringed element are the visual centerpiece of the hero. Below, sections in
    this exact
    order, separated by hairline #2A2A3A borders: a wide live-demo band
    showing a dashed ring around one page element with a small pill; a single
    row of exactly seven small dark screenshot thumbnails; a bento grid of
    exactly six raised dark
    tiles with gray placeholder bars and small glyphs; a small heading "Add
    your site, get your tag" (spelled exactly) above a wide dark code
    snippet panel holding only abstract gray bars of varied widths
    and indents — zero characters, no code — and one small
    icon-only copy button with no text label; a
    short two-column text row with monospaced bars; a low roadmap row of small
    outline chips where exactly one tiny chip reads "Soon"; one small "FAQ"
    label above four slim textless accordion rows of gray bars — the word FAQ
    appears exactly once; a final full-width ember-tinted strip with one
    textless ember button. The ONLY text in the whole image is exactly: annotate ·
    Feedback that points at the thing. · annotate pins threaded comments to
    the exact element or text they're about. · Try it on this page · Start
    free · No signup to look around. To post or install: create an account,
    add your site, paste your tag. · Add your site, get your tag · Export ·
    patch ready · Resolved · Soon · FAQ. All other copy
    is abstract gray placeholder bars. Large crisp Inter-style grotesque type
    for headline and buttons, small muted type for the subhead, high
    contrast, no duplicated or warped text. Calm, precise, generous even
    margins.
  negative: >-
    garbled glyphs, pseudo-letters, misspelled words, duplicated text, prices,
    dollar signs, currency, any real brand name or logo, URLs, hex codes, hash
    symbols, photographic people or faces, initials in avatars, blue or green
    glow, light theme, rainbow gradients, second saturated hue,
    ticket-creation card, Jira or tracker logo, lens flares, watermark,
    cluttered spacing, annoate or anobate misspellings of the wordmark,
    legible or semi-legible code characters, a button labeled Copy, a
    button labeled Try it free, the string Add to your site, annocate,
    annobate, extra legible section labels, colored words inside the subhead
  style: >-
    dark-native flat UI illustration, vector-sharp, single warm ember accent
    #F97316, luminosity hierarchy only, hairline borders, generous negative
    space

output:
  formats:
    - format: png
  dimensions: {width: 832, height: 1248, aspect_ratio: '2:3'}

requirements:
  subject: complete dark landing page, nav to final CTA strip, hero with
    ringed element, comment thread, agent card, bento, snippet, roadmap, FAQ
  composition: single continuous vertical page in approved order (hero,
    demo band, seven thumbnails, bento, snippet, agents row, roadmap, FAQ,
    strip); rail flush-docked right; ember reserved for ring, pin, primary CTA
  palette: >-
    void #0B0B10, canvas #111118, surface #1A1A23, raised #23232E, mist
    #2A2A3A, ember #F97316
  dont: [prices, brand logos, URLs, extra text, faces, second glow hue,
    ticket-creation imagery as a shipped step]

eval:
  pass_threshold: 0.75
  required_pass: [text_legibility, full_page_structure, accent_budget]
  criteria:
    text_legibility: {weight: 3, description: exact string manifest, crisp, no garbled glyphs}
    full_page_structure: {weight: 3, description: nav, hero with CTAs, demo band, seven
      thumbnails, bento, snippet, agents row, roadmap with Soon chip, FAQ, final strip —
      present, ordered, rail attached}
    accent_budget: {weight: 2, description: only ring, pin and primary buttons are saturated orange}
  reject_if: [garbled or misspelled text, price or currency symbol, third-party logo,
    light theme, detached floating rail, ticket-creation card shown as shipped]

tags: [marketing, landing-fullpage, annotate, ember-nocturne-v2, ai-generated]
product_targets: [annotate.therobotlives.com]
